OL,3,GNEWSALittle-Pengelly criticises O'Neill
OL,4,Aas nationalist first ministers to meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein's John O'Dowd said O'Neill
OL,7,Fwas attending in her role as party
OL,8,Fdeputy leader, adding it was "proper"
OL,9,Fthat parties in favour of greater self-
OL,10,Fdetermination work with each other.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
